
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="pt-BR">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
  <title>IZGAME</title>
  <style>
    * { box-sizing: border-box; }
    body {
      margin: 0;
      min-height: 100vh;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      background: #0b0d12;
      color: #fff;
      font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
    }
    main { text-align: center; padding: 24px; }
    h1 { font-size: 64px; letter-spacing: 8px; margin: 0; }
    p { color: #9ca3af; margin: 20px 0; }
    .status {
      display: inline-block;
      padding: 10px 18px;
      background: #202536;
      color: #b3bdfd;
      border-radius: 30px;
      font-size: 14px;
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <main>
    <h1>IZGAME</h1>
    <p>Algo novo está chegando.</p>
    <span class="status">Em desenvolvimento</span>
  </main>
</body>
</html>
